hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"468","Abu Kamil al-Fudayl ibn al-Husayn al-Jahdari narrated to us, Abd al-Wahid narrated to us, Salih ibn Salih narrated to us. Abu Ma'shar narrated to us that a man applied depilatory paste to the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and when he reached the pubic region the man held back, and the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) applied it to himself."
"469","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Ishaq al-Adhrami narrated to us, Abd al-Wahhab, meaning Ibn Ata, narrated to us, from Sa'id, from Qatadah, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) never used depilatory paste, nor did Abu Bakr, nor Umar, nor Uthman."
